@lczment/dsh-window README · DSH Window：[English](README.en.md) | 简体中文

给 **DeepSeek Harness Desktop** 加两件事：关闭窗口时由你决定「最小化到后台」还是「完全退出」，以及把某个会话 / 整个工作区丢进独立子窗口。

> 这是第三方扩展，不是 DeepSeek 官方组件。它会修改本机 DeepSeek Harness 的 `resources/app`（见「安装」），升级 DSH 后需要重跑一次安装脚本。

@lczment/dsh-window README · 3. 验证：- 设置页顶部显示绿色 “Desktop shell extension is installed”。
- 关闭主窗口 → 出现与主界面同风格的对话框。
- 侧栏会话悬停 → 出现窗口图标；点击后新窗口加载该会话。

@lczment/dsh-window README · 先退出 DeepSeek Harness：该索引使用 npm 源，安装走 `@lczment/dsh-window`。
- 也可以直接按仓库安装：`dsh plugin add github:lczment/dsh-window`，或下载 [Release v0.1.0](https://github.com/lczment/dsh-window/releases/tag/v0.1.0) 的 `dsh-window.tgz`。
- 官方列表条目已提交：[awesome-dsh-plugin#12113](https://github.com/awesome-dsh-plugin/awesome-dsh-plugin/pull/12113)（`market/lczment__dsh-window.yml`）。

@lczment/dsh-window README · DSH Window：English | [简体中文](README.md)

A small add-on for **DeepSeek Harness Desktop**: choose what closing the window does, and open a session or a whole workspace in its own child window.

> This is a third-party add-on, not an official DeepSeek component. It patches the local DeepSeek Harness `resources/app` (see *Install*) and must be re-applied after a DSH update.

@lczment/dsh-window README · What is inside：DSH plugins run in the Host (a Node child process) and the web frontend, and they have **no** IPC for windows or quitting. The project therefore has two parts:

1. **Plugin** (`index.js` / `client.js`, repository root) — settings section, sidebar buttons, per-session button, the close dialog UI, and Host routes.
2. **Shell extension** (`shell/install.mjs`) — injected into the Electron main process; owns window closing, child windows, and the shared policy file. Install scripts live in `tools/`.

@lczment/dsh-window README · 1. Install the plugin：- Install from the market / CLI: `dsh plugin add @lczment/dsh-window`, or search "DSH Window" in **Settings → Plugins → Discover**;
- The catalog entry is submitted as [awesome-dsh-plugin#12113](https://github.com/awesome-dsh-plugin/awesome-dsh-plugin/pull/12113) and appears on the default shelf once the index is rebuilt;
- Or install straight from the repository: `dsh plugin add github:lczment/dsh-window`;
- For local development, link the directory to `%USERPROFILE%\.dsh\profiles\desktop\node_modules\@lczment\dsh-window`.

@lczment/dsh-window README · then: tray icon → Quit. The app comes back with the extension within a minute：`--stage-only` unpacks `resources/app.asar` into `resources/app`, overlays `app.asar.unpacked`, patches `lib/main.js` (close hook, child-window WebSocket allowlist, child-window IPC), adds the `window.dshWindow` bridge to `lib/preload-app.cjs`, and waits for the app to exit before renaming `app.asar` to `app.asar.orig`.powershell
$env:DSH_DESKTOP_ROOT = 'E:\Apps\DeepSeek Harness'
```

@lczment/dsh-window README · 3. Verify：- The settings page shows a green "Desktop shell extension is installed".
- Closing the main window shows the in-app dialog.
- Hovering a sidebar session shows the window icon; clicking loads that session in a new window.

@lczment/dsh-window README · quit DeepSeek Harness first：That index uses the npm source and installs `@lczment/dsh-window`.
- You can also install straight from the repository: `dsh plugin add github:lczment/dsh-window`, or download `dsh-window.tgz` from [Release v0.1.0](https://github.com/lczment/dsh-window/releases/tag/v0.1.0).
- The catalog entry is submitted: [awesome-dsh-plugin#12113](https://github.com/awesome-dsh-plugin/awesome-dsh-plugin/pull/12113) (`market/lczment__dsh-window.yml`).
